cally do whatever they  wanted we discover that millie has a  lawsuit against antoine and she breaks  into free city in order to find evidence  that he stole the algorithm and this is  where she comes across guy now in the  movie we learned that keys actually  planted a program within guy that would  spark up life inside the simulation and  that this would be set off when he came  across the love of his life guy was  someone who was constantly searching for  his soulmate and coming across this  would mean that it would spark up  something between the two which would  have a knock on effect inside the sim as  we learn at the end of the movie keys  actually love millie and he based this  soulmate idea on her guy passing millie  in the street sets off a chain of events  in which he breaks from his programming  and begins to learn he offers to help  milly get what she's after but she says  he's not a high enough level and as we  know women they only care when you get  to level 69 now whereas free city is  pretty much afraid for all guy decides  to do good and slowly he goes viral on  the internet as a hero no one realizes  that he's actually an npc and everyone  including millie starts to fall in love  with him all the girls say he's pretty  fly for a white guy and he catches the  attention of not only millie but also  pokemane in one of the film's many  cameos now there's a ton of youtubers in  the film including ninja and also laser  beam dantdm and jacksepticeye there's  also ign bloody ign probably give it a 5  out of 10 for being too free of a city  probably started off the review by  saying free guy makes you feel like free  guy they're idiots anyway the cameos  extend beyond this and since its release  we've also learned that several actors  have given their voices to characters in  the film this includes hugh jackman who  appears at the start there's also the  rock tina fey john krasinski and  channing tatum appears as one of the  avatars in probably the funniest scene  in the movie on top of this chris evans  shows up at the end when guy gets some  avengers power-ups including captain  america's shield and also hulk's fist  this was possible because disney  recently acquired fox and thus they were  able to move the right across for this  movie there's also a lightsaber and a  poster for deadpool pops about one point  which is of course a character close to  reynolds heart we can also catch the  gravity and portalgun at one point and  the film is filled to the brim with nods  to movies and games alex trebek also  appears and sadly the jeopardy host  passed away in 2020 before this film was  released now i have to say the movie is  really a blast and as someone who didn't  think it would work i was pleasantly  surprised the film deals with a lot of  themes including individuality finding a  purpose love friendship and also  appreciating the good in life guy  initially has an existential crisis upon  learning that he's a game character and  he fears that he's not real he worries  that nothing matters but if you spend  your days just making youtube videos  does anything matter really probably not  but you know we find the good in life  and that's what guy very much does with  his own existence now antoine is in the  middle of launching free city 2 which  will completely replace everything in  the first game and mean that guy's  programming is wiped though it seems  like million keys original code is  completely missing they realized that  antoine was too lazy to scrub the  reflections and thus guy catches it when  opening his blinds a routine that he  goes through every day it's a race  against time as they try to get to the  island beyond the sea in order to expose  antoine he throws everything he can at  them including a half developed  bodybuilding clone of guy with a blue  shirt tattoo who he learns called the  dude guy manages to beat him and he gets  to the island which exposes the paradise  that million keys developed 