 wait to  watch it again free guy was great and in  the end i'm scoring it an 8 out of 10.  now obviously i'd love to hear your  thoughts on free guy so make sure you  comment below and let me know we're  running a competition right now and  giving away three mcu box sets on the  30th of august and all you have to do to  be with a chance of winning is like the  video make sure you subscribe with  notifications on and drop a comment  below with your thoughts on the film we  picked the comments at random at the end  of the month and the winners of the last  one are on screen right now so that's  you then message me on twitter at  heavyspoilers if you want to see some  more marvel related stuff then make sure  you check out our breakdown of captain  america the first avenger it's an oldie  but a goodie and we found a lot of never  before seen easter eggs and hidden plot  details that only now pay off with the  first episode of what if if not then  thank you for sitting until the end of  the video i've been paul you've been the  best and i'll see you next time take  care peace

